{"page":20116,"part":1,"text":"小王书\n\n\n小王书\n\n世称“小王书”，盖称太宗皇帝时王著也。本学虞永兴书，其波磔加长，体尚妩媚，然全无骨力。方上集刊法帖时，著预校定，识鉴凡浅，不无谬误。如列王坦之于逸少诸子间，意谓名皆从之。殊不知坦之乃王述之子，自太原王耳，非琅邪族也。黄长睿《志》及《书苑》云： “僧怀仁集右军书唐文皇制《圣教序》，近世翰林侍书辈学此，目曰院体，自唐世吴通微兄弟已有斯目。”今中都习书诰敕者，悉规仿著字，谓之“小王书”，亦曰“院体”，言翰林院所尚也。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20116,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"64cabac86e3e3758012506c360354a6ca6aaed082867898c2b40627749165206","textSha256":"64cabac86e3e3758012506c360354a6ca6aaed082867898c2b40627749165206","fileSha256":"64cabac86e3e3758012506c360354a6ca6aaed082867898c2b40627749165206","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20116-work-117.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"负暄野录 · 小王书","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/jUfro2aGUdYe1C5AQUsp44","originalPages":[390],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":4,"sourceTextSha256":"957955820318923ae25e830c6041e08c855993edfcd4cef20ca0f58424bfdf90","id":"local-390-189-199","page_id":390,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":189,"rawEnd":199,"reviewedTextSha256":"b8721fedde0ffceb97838c626b738590bb6e523ac06b4d6d43b4573c5d7c3d5d","displayUnitOrigins":[[195,196],[196,197],[197,198],[198,199]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":390,"part":2,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"郑雨荻","verifiedAt":"2026-10-19T13:36:56.116Z","revision":"b8721fedde0ffceb97838c626b738590bb6e523ac06b4d6d43b4573c5d7c3d5d","textSha256":"b8721fedde0ffceb97838c626b738590bb6e523ac06b4d6d43b4573c5d7c3d5d","fileSha256":"a7959b8ad3ac4b1328d4afcc5960761834bc9dbc83e2ea2d0c51808b9658a61c","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-初筛进度